Z||000002||Standard||01-22-2001||03:50 AM||||Well, there are 4 light bulbs back there, but if the first one was burnt out than I don't think the O would light up, either.. hmmm..  Just pop those plastic covers off above the taillights and unscrew the left one, rotate the light bulb holder to release it...||||reg||1
